## 6. Priority Roadmap Recommendation

### Tier 1 — Must ship before first paying customer
1. **Deployment setup** (Dockerfile, CI/CD, production DB)
2. **Barcode scanning** on POS
3. **Paystack payment integration** (bank transfer + card)
4. **Expense tracking** (basic categories + dashboard widget)

### Tier 2 — Must ship within 30 days of launch
5. **WhatsApp receipt delivery** (via 360Dialog or WATI)
6. **FIRS tax compliance reports** (VAT summary, tax invoices)
7. **Multi-language support** (Pidgin + Yoruba for POS screen)
8. **Settings security tab** (password change, active sessions)
9. **Daily business summary notifications** (email + push)

### Tier 3 — Growth & differentiation features
10. **Multi-branch support** (schema + UI)
11. **Customer loyalty program**
12. **Product expiry batch tracking**
13. **AI-powered insights** (dead stock, demand forecast, peak hours)
14. **WhatsApp credit reminders**
15. **Accounting export / integration**
16. **Staff payroll / commission tracking**

---

## 7. The Refined Elevator Pitch

> **NaijaStock** is the only POS system built from ground up for Nigerian retail in 2026.
> 
> It works offline in any market — Oshodi, Ariaria, Onitsha — with no terminal needed.  
> It tracks your credit customers and sends reminders on WhatsApp.  
> It shows you *real profit*, not just revenue — including your generator fuel and rent.  
> It generates FIRS-ready tax reports so your accountant is happy.  
> It speaks Pidgin.  
> And it runs on any phone — install it like an app, no Play Store needed.
> 
> Moniepoint gives you a terminal. NaijaStock gives you a **business brain**.
